# Every text file is LF in the repository AND in the working copy, on every
# OS. The repository has been LF all along; what this changes is checkout on
# Windows, where core.autocrlf=true (Git for Windows' default) wrote CRLF. That
# made the plugin registrants Flutter regenerates with LF show as modified
# after every `flutter pub get`, and put CRLF into the bash scripts. Binary
# files are detected by text=auto and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only script formats keep CRLF, which cmd and older PowerShell expect.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
